      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该记者自称“华丽一族”的狂热粉丝，\n他以某位赛马娘为例，\n点出身为粉丝的疑虑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9b79a4d1203c26b7ec129abe93fed70f77e741aa50fba610e9a7ecb5b659d34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
